# ─── Plugin symlink note ────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is the plugin only.
# To test locally, symlink this folder into your UE project:
# Windows: mklink /D "UEProject/Plugins/ReactorKit" "path/to/ReactorKit"
# Mac/Linux: ln -s "path/to/ReactorKit" "UEProject/Plugins/ReactorKit"